<p>Hello Vanessa,<br />
<br />
Thank you for wanting to host a blood drive.&nbsp; Our Blood Program Sponsors are very important to helping us ensure a safe and reliable blood supply for our hospitals and patients.&nbsp; Eric Holden will be reaching out to you to help you get things started.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />
Our process for hosting a drive is a 12 week timeline.&nbsp; Now is the time for you to survey your donor pool to determine how many donors will participate in your blood drive program.&nbsp; I am attaching an Interest Survey for you to keep track of the generous donors who say YES! to saving lives.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Attached, please find the survey and a Blood Program Sponsor Sheet to help you understand your role.<br />
